# Build-time target for the sandbox estate. Committed on purpose: it holds no
# secret, only which API the bundle should call, and the value has to travel
# with the repo so a server can build this without anyone remembering a flag.
#
# Used by `npm run build:sandbox`, which writes to dist-sandbox/ so it can sit
# alongside the production dist/ on the same box.
VITE_API_URL=https://sandbox.agendamoney.com
